{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50633","headline":"题云居上寺 · 吉騊駼","name":"题云居上寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石室最高峯，跻攀到此中。\n白云连晚翠，清磬度秋风。\n未悟无生理，宁知有想空。\n且归山下寺，更欲问支公。\n（见《金石萃编》卷一百五。\n）（按诗次轩辕伟诗後，原题曰「同前」，下署「騊駼上」，无官衔。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吉騊駼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}